  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "雷射加工原理與應用",
    "sub_ename": "LASER FABRICATION AND MACHINING OF MATERIAL",
    "describe_ch": "簡介雷射與物質交互作用時之物理現象。課程包含各式常見之雷射加工系統，並針對不同型態的雷射做簡介，雷射加工相關應用包含鑽孔、切割與焊接。",
    "describe_eh": "In this course, we will discuss the physics phenomena during the interactions between laser and material. An introduction of laser machining system and different laser configurations will be given. The related applications of laser processing include drilling, cutting and welding.",
    "pre_subname": "OPT3001雷射與光子學導論",
    "pre_sub_id3": "OPT3001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "OPT3001 INTRODUCTION TO LASER & PHOTONICS",
    "pre_describe": null,
